Left out on purpose: view and application things (follow mode, fullscreen, docks, colors of the
GUI, opening editor windows, plugin and synth GUIs, global settings, shortcuts, midi sync setup,
appearance, help).

Suggested order (my view, by what an assistant working in a song needs most):
  1. Automation (1-4)
  2. Part editing (5-12)
  3. Mixer and track completeness (24-27, 31-33)
  4. Midi functions and controllers (16-22)
  5. File import/export (42-44)
  6. Tempo, signature and key map (38-39)
